Package: codepc-link
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: CodePC Link contributors <ami3go@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-dbus-next (>= 0.2.3), bluez, network-manager, cockpit
Homepage: https://github.com/ami3go/codepc-link
Description: Bluetooth status and Cockpit discovery companion
 CodePC Link provides a secure Bluetooth Classic RFCOMM status service,
 server-initiated Android pairing controls, and a Cockpit management page.
